# Docker does not read .gitignore, and data/ alone is 399GB -- without this
# every build tries to ship the whole corpus to the daemon and appears to hang.
data*/
# ...except the backlink counts the API image bakes in. Exceptions must come
# after the rule they carve out of; without this the COPY in api.Dockerfile
# fails with "file not found in build context" even though the file exists.
!data/processed/wiki_backlink_counts.db
# ...and the FAISS index, which docker/lambda.Dockerfile bakes in. Lambda has
# no persistent local disk to stage an S3 download onto (/tmp is 512MB by
# default and is wiped between cold starts), so the index has to ship in the
# image. The App Runner image does not use this and downloads from S3.
!data/processed/models/baseline/runs/all-MiniLM-L6/paragraphs.index
spark-temp/
wikiextractor*/
.venv/
venv/
notebooks/
research/
.git/
.pytest_cache/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
